InsetBox[StyleBox["Retained context–TNN experience feeds later MTP updates", FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro", FontSize->17, FontWeight->"Bold", FontColor->RGBColor[0.9725, 0.4275, 0.4235]], {500, 14}, Center]
}, ImageSize->960, AspectRatio->0.3, PlotRange->{{0, 1000}, {0, 300}}, PlotRangePadding->None, ImagePadding->0, Background->RGBColor[0.0549, 0.0667, 0.0863]]
], "Diagram", Evaluatable->False, CellTags->"diagram:02_feedback"],

Cell["The feedback loop also reaches the generators: meta-training learns from the retained contexts and the TNN definitions associated with them.", "Text"]

