Cell["Variants may perturb weights or biases, exchange allowed activations, or change structure. A structural change requires regenerated or patched weights and biases; all dependent choices must still fit.", "Text"],

Cell["Candidate counts are per parameter family. The accepted result is one compatible TNN definition.", "Caption"]

}, Open]],

