Cell["The Boolean examples illustrate the matching contract. The Siamese network remains fixed during TGP and MTP; another matcher may implement the same role.", "Caption"]

}, Open]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["", "SlideShowNavigationBar", CellTags->"SlideShowHeader", CellOpen->False],

Cell["JITML  /  10", "SlideIndex"],

Cell["Usage controls specialist lifetime", "Section"],

Cell["The TNN lifespan policy rewards recurring use and ages inactivity. Selected specialists become “hotter”; unused ones become “colder” until retirement.", "Text"],

Cell[BoxData[
GraphicsBox[{
{FaceForm[RGBColor[0.0863, 0.1059, 0.1333]], EdgeForm[Directive[RGBColor[0.4431, 0.6667, 1], AbsoluteThickness[1.4]]], RectangleBox[{25, 212}, {475, 288}, RoundingRadius->10]},
InsetBox[StyleBox["Selected specialist", FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro", FontSize->20, FontWeight->"Bold", FontColor->RGBColor[0.8902, 0.9137, 0.9451]], {250, 259}, Center],
InsetBox[StyleBox["lifescore → lifescore − 1", FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro", FontSize->13.5, FontWeight->"Plain", FontColor->RGBColor[0.6588, 0.7098, 0.7765]], {250, 236}, Center],
{FaceForm[RGBColor[0.0863, 0.1059, 0.1333]], EdgeForm[Directive[RGBColor[0.9725, 0.4275, 0.4235], AbsoluteThickness[1.4]]], RectangleBox[{525, 212}, {975, 288}, RoundingRadius->10]},
InsetBox[StyleBox["Unused specialist", FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro", FontSize->20, FontWeight->"Bold", FontColor->RGBColor[0.8902, 0.9137, 0.9451]], {750, 259}, Center],
InsetBox[StyleBox["lifescore → lifescore + 1", FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro", FontSize->13.5, FontWeight->"Plain", FontColor->RGBColor[0.6588, 0.7098, 0.7765]], {750, 236}, Center],
{RGBColor[0.6588, 0.7098, 0.7765], AbsoluteThickness[1.6], Arrowheads[0.013], ArrowBox[{{750, 212}, {750, 182}}]},
{FaceForm[RGBColor[0.0863, 0.1059, 0.1333]], EdgeForm[Directive[RGBColor[0.9725, 0.4275, 0.4235], AbsoluteThickness[1.4]]], RectangleBox[{525, 116}, {975, 182}, RoundingRadius->10]},
InsetBox[StyleBox["Retirement condition reached", FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro", FontSize->17, FontWeight->"Bold", FontColor->RGBColor[0.8902, 0.9137, 0.9451]], {750, 158}, Center],
InsetBox[StyleBox["Purge the unused TNN", FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro", FontSize->13.5, FontWeight->"Plain", FontColor->RGBColor[0.6588, 0.7098, 0.7765]], {750, 135}, Center],
{RGBColor[0.6588, 0.7098, 0.7765], AbsoluteThickness[1.6], Arrowheads[0.013], ArrowBox[{{750, 116}, {750, 88}, {500, 88}, {500, 62}}]},
{FaceForm[RGBColor[0.0863, 0.1059, 0.1333]], EdgeForm[Directive[RGBColor[0.349, 0.7922, 0.7216], AbsoluteThickness[1.4]]], RectangleBox[{200, 6}, {800, 62}, RoundingRadius->10]},
InsetBox[StyleBox["If the pool is empty, restore dfque", FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro", FontSize->17, FontWeight->"Bold", FontColor->RGBColor[0.8902, 0.9137, 0.9451]], {500, 34}, Center],
InsetBox[StyleBox["Lower score = younger specialist", FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro", FontSize->21, FontWeight->"Bold", FontColor->RGBColor[0.4431, 0.6667, 1]], {250, 154}, Center],
InsetBox[StyleBox["Brief inactivity need not erase expertise", FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro", FontSize->15, FontWeight->"Plain", FontColor->RGBColor[0.6588, 0.7098, 0.7765]], {250, 119}, Center]
}, ImageSize->960, AspectRatio->0.3, PlotRange->{{0, 1000}, {0, 300}}, PlotRangePadding->None, ImagePadding->0, Background->RGBColor[0.0549, 0.0667, 0.0863]]
], "Diagram", Evaluatable->False, CellTags->"diagram:10_lifecycle"],

Cell["The default TNN set supplies a baseline when the pool is exhausted. An explicit capacity limit is an optional extension; the supplied architecture does not set a hard cap.", "Text"]

}, Open]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["", "SlideShowNavigationBar", CellTags->"SlideShowHeader", CellOpen->False],

Cell["JITML  /  11", "SlideIndex"],

Cell["Task use and generator use age differently", "Section"],

Cell["Reusing a TNN does not by itself age the MNN suite. Generator age tracks actual TGP work, while the MTP clock limits how often the system considers an update.", "Text"],

Cell[BoxData[
GraphicsBox[{
{FaceForm[RGBColor[0.1451, 0.1333, 0.1647]], EdgeForm[Directive[RGBColor[0.0549, 0.0667, 0.0863], AbsoluteThickness[0]]], RectangleBox[{25, 176}, {270, 218}, RoundingRadius->0]},
